
>> Size := Butang bag-o.
Size kon: ['is:'] buhata: { :numero
	numero kon: ['+'] buhata: { :numero
		>> unit := numero yunit-sa-numero.
		>> factor := 1.
		
		unit
		kaso: ['inch'] buhata: { factor := 0.0833. }. <- kaugalingon + (numero * factor).
	}. <- numero.
}.

# This size number can be used as follows:

>> plank := Size is: 6 foot.
>> edge := Size is: 50 inch.

# This will show as: 10.165
Gawas isulat: plank + edge, bag-ong-linya.
